{"version":1,"content":"<p>維珍銀河為其首艘新一代Delta級飛船命名為「Apeiron」，名稱來自古希臘語，意為「無限」或「無界」。公司表示，名字由來自83個國家、六大洲的公眾投票選出，意在體現太空探索的想像空間。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584192.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:01:12.364450+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:45:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:58:14.058935+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:58:14.058935+00:00","content_hash":"f8b7578ffda562258cbbf75f39cc160d6d48fb0af31e164357f7d8233cba4e98","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}